Xray-core (MPL-2.0)
  https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
  Shipped as an unmodified binary. Source and licence are at the URL above.

roscomvpn geoip / geosite data
  https://github.com/hydraponique/roscomvpn-geoip  release 202611221113
  https://github.com/hydraponique/roscomvpn-geosite  release 202610120948
  These repositories carry no licence file. Use is a known and accepted risk.
  The git-tracked release/ files at those tags, downloaded at build time with
  pinned SHA-256 (third_party/geo/pin.json).

v2fly geoip (CC-BY-SA-4.0)
  https://github.com/v2fly/geoip  release 202611080027
  geoip.dat, downloaded at build time with a pinned SHA-256. Used as the
  fallback source when roscomvpn has no such tag.

domain-list-community (MIT)
  https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community  release 20261122062944
  Copyright (c) v2fly contributors. dlc.dat, downloaded at build time with a
  pinned SHA-256; used as the fallback geosite.

golang.org/x/sys (BSD-3-Clause)
  https://go.googlesource.com/sys
  Copyright 2009 The Go Authors. Go module, compiled into Zatvor binaries.

xray-core common/geodata (MPL-2.0)
  https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
  Go module, compiled into Zatvor binaries: the geosite/geoip protobuf types
  used to merge geo data files.

google.golang.org/protobuf (BSD-3-Clause)
  https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf-go
  Copyright 2018 The Go Authors. Go module, compiled into Zatvor binaries.

github.com/tailscale/hujson (BSD-3-Clause)
  https://github.com/tailscale/hujson  v0.0.0-20260727124030-b80ff77dac4f
  Copyright (c) 2019 Tailscale Inc. Go module, compiled into Zatvor binaries:
  parses JSON with comments (VS Code and Claude Code settings) so that they
  are edited in place.

