sing (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing  v0.8.12-0.20260717023913-84ab32b56cb8
  Copyright (C) 2022 by nekohasekai. Go module, dependency of sing-tun.

Wintun (prebuilt binaries under the WireGuard LLC "Prebuilt Binaries
License"; source GPL-2.0 / MIT)
  https://www.wintun.net/  wintun-0.14.1.zip
  Downloaded with a pinned SHA-256 by proto/tun/check/Check.ps1 on CI for
  variant A (wintun.dll next to xray.exe); embedded by sing-tun in variant B.
  Redistribution terms must be checked before shipping (stage 3).

